# Architecture

Read PLAN.md. Do not reopen the stack or pipeline.

- Monorepo: `apps/web` (React), `apps/api` (FastAPI), `packages/contracts` (Zod), `packages/py-contracts` (Pydantic), `packages/agents`, `packages/sandbox`, `packages/templates`, `infra/`
- Stack: Vite + React + TS (web), FastAPI + Python (api, agents, sandbox), Postgres, Redis/ARQ, Docker sandbox, Traefik preview URLs
- Agents return `FileMap` only. Only `packages/sandbox` uses Docker
- Preview is an iframe URL, never inlined generated HTML. Monaco is not the live canvas
- Self-heal max 3 then `heal.exhausted`
- Smart Match runs before Code Generator and never auto-accepts
- Until P6-S1, actor is `dev-user`
